# unskip-day: train a skipped day of the current week after all, on-disk.
# Before: skip-day.steps ran on this store (Week 1 Days 2 and 4 skipped).
# After: ffive-verify store "select cast(ZSKIPPEDSESSIONS as text) from ZMESOCYCLE" lists only dayIndex 3, and
#        ffive-verify store "select ZNAME, ZWEEK, ZDAYINDEX, ZENDDATE from ZWORKOUT where ZDAYINDEX = 1" has an open Lower A row.
launch
wait text "WEEK 1 DAY 3" timeout=20
tap #workout.schedule
count button "forward.end.circle" "2"
tap button "forward.end.circle"
wait text "Train this day after all?"
tap #dialog.train-day
wait text "WEEK 1 DAY 2"
wait text "~Lower A"
shot 01-unskipped-session
tap #workout.schedule
count button "forward.end.circle" "1"
shot 02-schedule
